--- a/init/Kconfig
+++ b/init/Kconfig
@@ -800,6 +800,24 @@ menuconfig CGROUPS
 
 	  Say N if unsure.
 
+menuconfig CGROUPS_V2
+	bool "Cgroup v2 (Unified Hierarchy) support"
+	depends on CGROUPS
+	default y
+	help
+	  Enables the new unified hierarchy for cgroups (v2). This provides
+	  a single hierarchy for all cgroup controllers, simplifying management
+	  and providing better resource control.
+
+	  The unified hierarchy provides:
+	  - Simplified cgroup interface with single mount point
+	  - Better resource accounting and delegation
+	  - Improved memory, CPU, and IO control
+	  - PSI (Pressure Stall Information) metrics
+
+	  Recommended for systems using container technologies like Docker.
+	  Say Y if unsure.
+
 if CGROUPS
 
 config PAGE_COUNTER
